  "about": "Material 3 system tokens for the Afferent GUI, generated by design/mockups/final/tools/gen-gui-tokens.mjs from tools/seeds.json with Material Color Utilities. Do not edit by hand. design/tokens.json stays the source for game, world, mood and bedside colours.",
