    "about": "Seeds for the Afferent GUI colour system. Sky seeds come from QuantizerCelebi(128) plus Score(filter false) on the top 60% of a rendered game sky frame (demo/js/world.js), with the HCT hue rounded to 5 degrees so the result is deterministic. The lantern and aurora are fixed brand seeds from design/tokens.json.",
